  "body": "Here’s your chance to secure a prime slice of paradise in the sought-after West Hoe Heights. This elevated section captures sweeping sea views and offers the perfect platform to build your dream home or luxury retreat.\r\n\r\nEnjoy unbeatable convenience with Orewa’s vibrant town centre, top schools and stunning beaches just minutes away. It’s a location that blends lifestyle, leisure and liveability in one unbeatable package.\r\n\r\nOpportunities like this are rare — and with a motivated vendor, this property will be sold.\r\n\r\nAct now and make it yours!",
